---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import BrandNameWord from '../components/BrandNameWord.astro';
import hero from '../assets/images/hero.svg?url';
---

<MainLayout title="The impurrfect Speakeasy" description="The impurrfect Speakeasy — a hidden bar embracing wabi-sabi philosophy. Handcrafted cocktails and classic twists with a modern edge.">
  <div class="relative">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none opacity-[0.10]">
      <img src={hero} alt="" class="w-72 h-auto" aria-hidden="true" />
    </div>
    <div class="relative min-h-[80dvh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center space-y-6">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-widest text-cream">
        <BrandNameWord normalCase /><br>cat dive bar
      </h1>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p class="font-body text-stone-400 max-w-md mx-auto text-sm text-justify">
          We are not perfect. Our space is small, our furniture doesn't match, and our people are human. We built this with what we had. Our resident cats aren't flawless - they are survivors of the HCMC streets, some missing a leg, some with cloudy eyes, some with stories only the regulars know. But they are here: alive, thriving, and completely at home.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-stone-400 max-w-md mx-auto text-sm text-justify">
          You don't have to be perfect here, either. Come as you are, dust yourself off, pet a cat, and have a fair pour.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-stone-400 max-w-md mx-auto text-sm text-justify">
          We are not a high-end mixology lounge. We are a neighbourhood cat dive bar hidden in an alley. The drinks are proper, but the space is raw. We have no air conditioning, just the natural breeze and industrial fans. Smoking's fine, too, out in the alley.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-stone-400 max-w-md mx-auto text-sm text-justify">
          If you are looking for perfection, you won't find it here. But if you need an honest drink, a quiet corner to decompress after work, and a cat who will accept you exactly as you are... welcome home.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="font-body text-stone-400 max-w-md mx-auto text-sm">
        Our digital space is currently under construction, but our menu is fully live and ready for your viewing.
      </p>
      <div>
        <a
          href="/menu"
          class="inline-block bg-gold text-cream font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-sm hover:bg-gold-dark transition-colors duration-200 text-sm tracking-wide uppercase"
        >
          View Bar Menu
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
